<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head>
<meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>The Field Notes — Jungle Travels India</title>
<meta name="description" content="Our monthly journal — the rituals, wildlife and long roads we travel across India and the Northeast.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant:wght@400;500;600&family=EB+Garamond:ital@0;1&family=Jost:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{--paper:#F5F0E6;--paper-deep:#E9E2D4;--ink:#2B2B26;--body:#3F3E36;--green:#1F3D2B;--red:#7B2E2A;--red-dark:#5F231F;--gold:#8A7E63;--line:#D8CFBA;--sand:#D9B48A;
--serif:'Cormorant',Georgia,serif;--garamond:'EB Garamond',Georgia,serif;--sans:'Jost',Arial,sans-serif;}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0;}body{background:var(--paper);color:var(--body);font-family:var(--garamond);font-size:19px;line-height:1.7;}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none;}img{display:block;max-width:100%;}
.wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 40px;}
.eyebrow{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:4px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--red);}
h1,h2,h3{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:600;color:var(--green);line-height:1.12;}
.nav{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);}.nav .wrap{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:16px 40px;}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;}.brand .jti{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:24px;letter-spacing:2px;color:var(--green);}
.brand .sq{width:10px;height:10px;background:var(--red);}.brand .full{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:3px;color:var(--gold);text-transform:uppercase;}
.menu a{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:13px;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-left:26px;}
.hero{background:var(--green);color:var(--paper);text-align:center;padding:80px 20px;}
.hero .eyebrow{color:var(--sand);}.hero h1{color:var(--paper);font-size:54px;margin:14px 0;}
.hero p{color:#CFD8C8;font-style:italic;font-size:20px;max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:26px;padding:70px 0 90px;}
.fn{display:block;background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);transition:.25s;}
.fn:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:0 16px 40px rgba(31,61,43,.12);}
.fn .band{height:220px;overflow:hidden;}.fn .band img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;}
.fn .b{padding:24px 26px 28px;}.fn .k{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold);}
.fn h3{font-size:22px;margin:8px 0 0;line-height:1.25;}
footer{background:#16241B;color:#9DAD97;text-align:center;padding:40px 20px;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1px;}
footer a{color:var(--sand);}
@media(max-width:820px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.wrap{padding:0 24px;}.hero h1{font-size:36px;}}
</style></head><body>
<header class="nav"><div class="wrap"><a class="brand" href="/"><span class="jti">JTI</span><span class="sq"></span><span class="full">Jungle&nbsp;Travels&nbsp;India</span></a>
<nav class="menu"><a href="/">Home</a><a href="/tours/">Journeys</a><a href="/field-notes/">Field Notes</a><a href="/#enquire">Enquire</a></nav></div></header>
<section class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">Stories from the field</p><h1>The Field Notes</h1>
<p>Our monthly journal — the rituals, wildlife and long roads we travel across India and the Northeast.</p></section>
<div class="wrap"><div class="grid">
{% for s in collections.stories %}
<a class="fn" href="/field-notes/{{ s.data.slug }}/"><div class="band"><img src="{{ s.data.hero_image if s.data.hero_image else s.data.hero_fallback }}" alt=""></div>
<div class="b"><p class="k">{{ s.data.kicker }}</p><h3>{{ s.data.title }}</h3></div></a>
{% endfor %}
</div></div>
<footer>© 2026 {{ site.name }} · Part of JTI Group &nbsp;·&nbsp; <a href="tel:{{ site.phone_raw }}">{{ site.phone }}</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp; <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a></footer>
</body></html>
